flowchart TD
  A[repository_dispatch pkgbuild-built] --> B[resolve payload]
  C[workflow_dispatch] --> B

  B --> D[create GitHub App token]
  D --> E[checkout repo]
  E --> F[verify bootstrap release has dystopian-repo, dystopian-keyring, and db]
  F --> G[resolve package asset from PKGBUILDS release]
  G --> H[download package into x86_64]
  H --> I[import GPG packager key]
  I --> J[sign package and repo-add into db]
  J --> K[commit and push x86_64 artifacts]
  K --> L{package is dystopian-repo?}
  L -- yes --> M[notify PKGBUILDS with repo signature URL]
